---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms governing the use of the Replyly browser extension and landing website."
  lastUpdated="September 2026"
>
  <section class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p>
      By downloading, installing, or using the Replyly browser extension ("Software") or visiting this website, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, do not install or use the Software.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight">2. Open Source License</h2>
    <p>
      The Replyly source code is distributed under the <strong>MIT License</strong>. You are free to inspect, fork, modify, and distribute the Software subject to the conditions of the license located in the root repository.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight">3. User Responsibility & Third-Party AI Services</h2>
    <p>
      Replyly functions as a client-side interface allowing you to connect to third-party AI APIs (Google Gemini, Groq, OpenRouter).
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li>You are responsible for obtaining and managing your own API keys.</li>
      <li>You agree to comply with the respective Terms of Service and Acceptable Use Policies of the AI providers whose services you connect to Replyly.</li>
      <li>You are solely responsible for all content, text, or comments you choose to post on social platforms using generated drafts.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight">4. Prohibited Uses</h2>
    <p>
      You agree not to use Replyly to:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li>Generate or transmit hate speech, harassment, defamation, or unlawful material.</li>
      <li>Perform automated spamming, astroturfing, or malicious manipulation of social network algorithms.</li>
      <li>Violate the terms of service of X (Twitter), LinkedIn, or any platform you interact with.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
    <p>
      THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHORS OR COPYRIGHT HOLDERS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="space-y-4">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink tracking-tight">6. Changes to Terms</h2>
    <p>
      We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Continued use of the Software following any changes constitutes acceptance of those changes.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalLayout>
